2. What this version changes
----------------------------

The following are modifications made for this version. They are not part of
the original Turbo Kart Rally release.

- Game source: online multiplayer (lobby screens, race entry, a shared start,
  remote kart and AI state, host-authoritative race progress), additional
  maps, themes, track details, custom kart models and power-ups, online
  diagnostics, and the About / Licences screen.
  Files added after the original release: src/characters.js,
  src/custom-icons.js, src/custom-kart-list.js, src/custom-karts.js,
  src/custom-powerups.js, src/environment-themes.js, src/lobby-refresh.js,
  src/multiplayer.js, src/netdiag.js, src/netplay.js, src/progress.js,
  src/road-themes.js, src/track-obstacles.js, src/track-textures.js,
  src/about.js and src/maps/. Several original files (for example
  src/main.js, src/menu.js, src/hud.js, src/kart.js) were also changed.
- Electron desktop application, based on Holochain's Kangaroo Electron
  template.
- Holochain: player identity, multiplayer discovery, lobbies and race
  admission.
- Authenticated realtime networking over iroh and MoQ (a separate "kart-net"
  sidecar process).


